No results matching \"\"\n    \n\n"},"injectables/ZipExportService.html":{"url":"injectables/ZipExportService.html","title":"injectable - ZipExportService","body":"\n                   \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  Injectables\n  ZipExportService\n\n\n\n    \n    documentation/template-playground/zip-export.service.ts\n\n\n\n        \n            Info\n        \n        \n            API\n        \n        \n            Source\n        \n\n\n\n    \n\n\n\n        \n            Metadata\n            \n                \n                    \n                        providedIn\n                        root\n                    \n                \n            \n        \n\n\n                \n            Relationships\n\n            \n                \n                    Used by\n                        \n                                \n                                            TemplatePlaygroundModule\n                                \n                        \n                \n\n                \n                    Depends on\n                        No results matching.\n                \n            \n        \n    \n\n    \n            \n    Index\n\n        \n            \n                \n                    \n                        Methods\n                    \n                    \n                        \n                            \n                                M\n                                    Private\n                                downloadBlob\n                            \n                            \n                                M\n                                exportTemplates\n                            \n                            \n                                M\n                                    Private\n                                generateReadme\n                            \n                        \n                    \n                \n            \n        \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n            \n    \n    \n      